# ADDED FOR THE GREEN DEVOPS EXPERIMENT. Not part of the upstream project.
# BuildKit reads <dockerfile>.dockerignore in preference to .dockerignore, so
# this applies ONLY to Dockerfile.experiment and leaves the project's own
# .dockerignore untouched. The packaging image must SHIP dist/ and
# node_modules, which the project's own ignore file excludes; everything else
# is left out of the context.
*
!backend/package.json
!backend/package-lock.json
!backend/node_modules
!backend/dist
!backend/docker-entrypoint.sh
!database/schema.sql
!database/migrations
!docs/release-notes
